{"changeContract":{"acceptance":[{"id":"ci-and-staged-boundary","statement":"增加普通 Windows x64、macOS x64/arm64 原型 CI 入口及 Node 22.13.0/24.13.0 矩阵、摘要绑定的受控构建结果交接和文档；本期仅验证配置与工具准备就绪。缺原生结果保持待验收并阻塞后续集成，不阻塞本期准备交付；保持现有 Linux bwrap、存储/生成物/分发测试和生产模式不变，不以 CI 配置或模拟结果宣称原生支持。","verification":{"args":[],"classification":"expected-green","id":"accept-ci-and-staged-boundary","kind":"vitest","minTests":3,"runner":{"command":"vitest run","kind":"package-script","packageManager":"bun","script":"test:target"},"testFiles":["test/distribution.test.mjs","test/host-prototype-ci.test.ts","test/traceability-check.test.mjs"]}},{"id":"prototype-build-preparation","statement":"提供未接入生产的 Windows Job Object launcher 原型源码及显式构建工具：协议和构建参数可在 Linux 测试，拒绝不安全/不支持输入，不下载或运行时编译，实际 Windows 构建另行生成二进制和源码/工具链/产物摘要。源码设计要求挂起创建、归属后运行及有界终止；本地源码检查不等于原生生命周期证明。","verification":{"args":[],"classification":"expected-green","id":"accept-prototype-build-preparation","kind":"vitest","minTests":2,"runner":{"command":"vitest run","kind":"package-script","packageManager":"bun","script":"test:target"},"testFiles":["test/host-prototype-build.test.ts","test/isolation-backend.test.ts"]}},{"id":"qualification-harness-preparation","statement":"提供 macOS 进程组原型、受限生命周期夹具及原生资格执行入口；本地测试协议、结果校验、缺能力失败与模拟工具调用，不冒充原生通过。实际入口要求匹配平台/架构、Node 版本及产物身份，真实执行成功才能产出资格结果；根退出/后代回收/无法确认分开，基础设施失败不是 expected-red。","verification":{"args":[],"classification":"expected-green","id":"accept-qualification-harness-preparation","kind":"vitest","minTests":2,"runner":{"command":"vitest run","kind":"package-script","packageManager":"bun","script":"test:target"},"testFiles":["test/host-prototype-harness.test.ts","test/isolation-backend.test.ts"]}}],"constraints":[{"id":"design-boundary","statement":"本轮 Design 不实现或运行产品测试，仅修订本 change 设计与封存。既有 Diagnose 941通过25跳过为历史 Linux 结果，非本轮或原生验收。"},{"id":"honest-evidence","statement":"本地协议/模拟/源码检查只证明准备合同；Windows/macOS 真实结果缺失时标待验收，错平台/缺工具/编译/超时/终止失败不能以 skip 或 expected-red 消化；记录原生 OS/架构/Node/工具链与产物身份且不含环境值凭据。"},{"id":"no-framework-or-dependencies","statement":"无新增第三方依赖、通用远程执行/CI证据导入平台、原生安全沙箱或 VM；源码/脚本为文本，二进制仅显式受控构建产生，不改变 Worker 提交协议，不运行时下载编译，不发布提交。"},{"id":"preparation-only","statement":"仅独立 scripts 原型、测试、CI 与文档；不修改 src 生产路径/状态/凭证/预算/恢复逻辑，不启用 host-trusted，不修改默认模式或 Linux local-trusted，不将未验证原型作为可用宿主后端。"},{"id":"preserve-existing","statement":"保留当前 fsync/异常暂停/旧 interrupted/事务故障/生成物修复，不覆盖撤销或重复实现；不操作目标用户运行或数据库，不跨平台复制状态，不重置预算或要求 discard。"},{"id":"retain-target","statement":"B1/T1 完整产品方向仍为后续目标；真实原型资格先于依赖集成，后续完整原生 Red/Green/reopen/累计/apply、环境身份与同 run 恢复要求不降低，不把本期 ready 当完整功能通过。"}],"goal":"完成 host-trusted 两阶段交付的首期：未接入生产的 Windows/macOS 生命周期原型源码、显式构建脚本、测试和普通原生 CI 入口；以本地可执行准备合同验收，不以缺少原生资格阻塞准备工作，也不声称已支持原生宿主执行。","policy":{"dependencies":[],"verificationModes":["behavior"],"writeRoots":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","docs/host-trusted-preparation.md","scripts/host-prototype","test/host-prototype-build.test.ts","test/host-prototype-ci.test.ts","test/host-prototype-harness.test.ts"]}},"changeId":"add-host-trusted-execution","outputs":[{"id":"build-test","path":"test/host-prototype-build.test.ts","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"red","taskId":"prep-build"}},{"id":"build-tool","path":"scripts/host-prototype/build.mjs","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"green","taskId":"prep-build"}},{"id":"ci-test","path":"test/host-prototype-ci.test.ts","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"red","taskId":"prep-ci"}},{"id":"fixture","path":"scripts/host-prototype/lifecycle-fixture.mjs","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"green","taskId":"prep-harness"}},{"id":"handoff-doc","path":"docs/host-trusted-preparation.md","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"green","taskId":"prep-ci"}},{"id":"harness-test","path":"test/host-prototype-harness.test.ts","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"red","taskId":"prep-harness"}},{"id":"macos-source","path":"scripts/host-prototype/macos-supervisor.mjs","postcondition":"regular-file","producer":{"phase":"green","tas